  "description": "26\" Electric Cruiser Bike – Stylish & Powerful 500W Ride for Adventure Seekers\nOmega is an electric cruiser bike with a fantastic and attractive design, coming with two 26” white wall tires, SHIMANO Tourney 7 speed rear derailleur, dual disk brakes, Panasonic built-in battery, LCD display, XIONGDA powerful motor with 48V, 500W, freestyle crankset, and so on. It is perfect for adventure lovers who enjoy comfortable rides.\n\nSADDLE\n\nVacuum elastic PVC leather high density PU foam with springs\n\nSHIFTERS\nA faster ride, right at your fingertips. Toggle between three levels of assist with easy-to-use on-bar controls. Shimano SL-RS35-R 7-speed\n\nREAR HUB MOTOR\nEquipped with 48V 500W light weight high speed brushless.\n\nSENSOR\nSpeed and Torque Integrated intelligent Pedals Assisted System\n\nEXTRAS\nThis Lithium Battery 26 Inch Electric Stretch Chopper Bike is powered by 48V/17.5Ah Li-ion battery which can be charged in 4-6 hours. It is constructed with Hi-ten steel. Equipped with 800W light weight high speed brushless rear wheel hub motor (EU), it can achieve a maximum speed of 25mile/h with a travel range of 30-50mile. It has an intelligent Pedals Assisted System 3 riding modes and 5 levels of pedal assist, which makes it like a normal bike and provides a natural riding experience, right at your fingertips. Toggle between three levels of assist with easy-to-use on-bar controls. Will be a better choice for long time travel and exercise.",
